<title>USA: Phoenix Information names Bloss its CEO.</title>
<headline>Phoenix Information names Bloss its CEO.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PETERSBURG, Fla. 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Phoenix Information Systems said on Tuesday it named Delbert Bloss chief executive.</p>
<p>Robert Gordon, the chairman, will remain actively involved with the company and continue to direct its long-term strategic plan, Phoenix said.</p>
<p>Bloss most recently headed the Forge Group, a consulting firm.</p>
<p>Phoenix develops technologies for automating the travel and tourism industry.</p>
</text>
